    },
    {
      "s": "",
      "t": "A",
      "n": "Intro2Audio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Of the animated, sadistic duo Itchy & Scratchy, Itchy is the mouse.",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "760425_2",
      "n": "ExplanationAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "So, you could name the mouse, Itchy, but who still uses a mouse, am i right? <sfx: clicking sounds> How do I get out of this question? <sfx: clicking also beep the curse word!>",
      "t": "A",
      "v": "760426_0f",
      "n": "JokeAudio"
    },
    {
      "s": "Say Apple, having exhausted all the big cat names for their OS, pivots to cartoon cats. Which would NOT be an option?",
